[00:01.64]Throughout our lifetime, We want to use each day
[00:10.38]To make a good name And all God’s laws obey.
[00:21.98]If in Jehovah’s sight We strive to do what’s right,
[00:32.46]Then we will please him, To his delight.
[00:42.53]This world may cause us To try to make a name,
[00:53.19]To seek its favor, To bask in its acclaim.
[01:03.68]But that is vanity, For if its friend we’ll be,
[01:13.26]Jehovah’s favor, We will not see.
[01:22.46]In God’s remembrance, We want our name to be
[01:34.24]And have a good name For all eternity.
[01:45.88]On him we can depend, So we his truth defend
[01:56.26]And keep our good name Down to the end.
